    {
      "text": "CTCAC application CA-26-715, Rise City Apartments: 94 total units, 93 low-income, 1304 Middlefield Road, APNs 053-145-240, 053-145-230, 053-145-260. Application, not an award: bond request $18,900,000, federal credit request $3,317,072 (CDLAC September 8, 2026 applicant list).",
