        "SRC-001685"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC application CA-26-715 (signed August 25, 2026): 94 units in one seven-story building with elevator, 93 low-income units and one manager unit; 24 units for persons with disabilities (5 of them also homeless), 15 ADA units, 23 units with a public employee housing preference. Zoning R-4; height limit 78 feet. Placed in service scheduled January 2029.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001685"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY (July 2023): 77-foot, seven-story building of about 96,880 square feet, with a two-floor podium garage, 42 car and 94 bicycle spaces; unit mix reported as 42 studios, 34 one-bedrooms and 19 two-bedrooms.",
